  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     AT TOP 6
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     AT BOTTOM 3
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     DATA RECORD ZPRINT.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 01  ZPRINT             PIC X(100) USAGE DISPLAY-1.
